@startuml DERAS_SystemFlow
!theme plain
title DERAS — System Flow (Activity)\nAcademic Year Resource Allocation Pipeline

|Admin / Super|
start
:Login;
:Open Dashboard;

|Master Data|
:Ensure Academic Year (current);
:Ensure Townships / Grades / Book Names;

|Student Quota|
:Enter Quota by Township\n(Primary / Middle / High / Agriculture);

|Textbook Path|
:Create Allocation Plan\n(year, grade, book,\nprevious / students / transferable);
:System calculates ratio &\ntownship allocation;
:Auto-sync Textbook issues\n& lookup previous balances;

|School Supply Path|
:Allocate school supplies\n(item × school_count × rate);
:Enter Supply Details\n(unit / issued);

|Teacher Guide Path|
:Record Receipt Quota\n(KG–G12 / G1–G5);
:Distribute to Townships\n(per guide type);
:Issue to Townships\n(package / loose computed);
:Update Summary\n(previous + quota − distributed);

|Admin / Super|
:Review Dashboard / Indexes;
:Logout;
stop

legend right
  |= Path |= Tables |
  | Textbook | quotas → allocation_plans →\nallocation_plan_townships → textbooks / stocks |
  | Supplies | school_supply_* → supply_details |
  | Teacher Guide | teacher_guides →\ntownship_allocations → issues → summaries |
endlegend

@enduml
